### commit
06173427 fix(weather): a waiter's replay says it waited through the failure; the test no longer races

A caller handed the outcome of a failure it waited through, after that
failure's pause had already run out, was logged as "no request for another
0 s", which reads like a fault. It now says that it waited through the
latest failure. The test for that case made sure the waiter had arrived by
sleeping a tenth of a second; on a loaded runner it could fail for no
reason. The patched clock now signals the waiter's arrival instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

